# Environment save and pull requests

`llceejll/.github` is a fork of `paperclipai/.github`. Issues are off, and the Cloud Agent GitHub integration is not a collaborator. Creating a pull request returns `must be a collaborator`. Do not retry pull request creation until Issues are enabled on this repository.

A run with no environment id cannot persist a dashboard Save. Keep the setup in `.cursor/environment.json`. After the user says Save will not work, do not propose the environment or ask for Save again.
